WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.510
This is The White Cloud,
a leader of the Iowa nation.

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:10.090
In 1844 and 1845, he and a small party
of Iowa traveled to Europe

3
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.850
and joined Catlin's touring Indian Gallery
in London and Paris,

4
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.550
partly to raise money
for their struggling people.

5
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:17.920
By then,

6
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.190
the Iowa had been pushed
onto a small reservation.

7
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.140
Now look at the soft,
cloudy backdrop and the romantic light.

8
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:29.210
They lift him out of his real situation,
a leader on a fundraising tour,

9
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.490
and place him in a timeless world.
